cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulation, please cite the paper it supports."
title: "ota-gating-sim: within-window atomic completion model for OTA update delivery"
abstract: >-
  Discrete-time Monte Carlo simulation of over-the-air update delivery to
  autonomous devices that alternate between operating in public space and
  sitting stationary where they can install. Completion requires a single
  stationary window long enough to transfer and install contiguously, which
  makes window length an independent driver of the preferred delivery
  architecture.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "3.0"
date-released: "2026-07-20"

authors:
